    "https://utwentecareers.nl/en/": {
      "title": "Looking for a jobthat matters?",
      "description": "Looking for a job that matters? | University of Twente Vacancies Academic staff Support staff UT Student Jobs UT as employer UT as employer Employment conditions Career and development Pre and onboarding Tenure Track PhD EngD Working as a UT student Stories from UT employees Job alert About UT Campus Research institutes Strategy and culture Twente and Enschede Nederlands English en Nederlands English Looking for a job that matters? Find your job at University of Twente Khiet Truong Hi! Are you our new colleague? Your job matters and so do you Find your job at University of Twente Will you be our new colleague? Want to create impact with a job that matters? Find your job at University of Twente Ali Sadeghi Hi! Are you our new colleague? Your job matters and so do you Find your job at University of Twente Will you be our new colleague? Create new possibilities for yourself and our society Find your job at University of Twente Yijian Zeng Hi! Are you our new colleague? Your job matters and so do you Find your job at University of Twente David Fernandez Hi! Are you our new colleague? Create new possibilities for yourself and our society Find your job at University of Twente Leandro de Santana & Kees Venner Will you be our new colleague? Where do your interests lie? Academic staff Support staff Assistant professor 1 EngD 1 PhD 4 PostDoc 3 Professor 1 View all Academic staff positions (10) Administrative & facility 1 Education 1 HRM 1 IT 2 Technical and laboratory 2 View all Support staff positions (7) Featured positions SCIENTIFIC DIRECTOR Digital Society Institute DSI Academic staff Professor Doctorate EEMCS 24 hour Challenging work Medior Java Developer Support staff IT Higher education (HBO) LISA 32 - 40 hour € 3,706 - € 5,760 Varied work High-tech human touch As a leading tech university, we are here to shape our world for the better with people-centred tech solutions. Become a part of our unique, campus-based community. With your unique talents and perspectives, you can help us to develop, share and apply knowledge with a view to impacting society, from the local to the global. Help us Shape the world for the better We do this, especially in fields where technology and people bring out the best in each other, like our university’s research themes. Whatever your job is at UT, you can contribute to these changes in many different ways. Get to know us Thrive in An open, inclusive, and entrepreneurial community At UT we are committed to creating equal opportunities for all. No matter what your role is – even if you are still finding your way – our aim is to help you thrive, whatever it takes. Because we believe that by being true to yourself, and by balancing personal well-being and professional growth, you can help us blaze new trails toward a fair, sustainable, and digital tomorrow. Starting right here, right now, with today’s tasks and interactions. Check out our vacancies Enjoy The freedom to choose We encourage each other to make work-life choices that fit our own individual needs. And our job conditions are tailored to that. At UT, you benefit from job flexibility and add-on services that can help you to flourish, both as a person and as a professional. Tap into our tax discount on making your home more sustainable, our sustainability investments, our career development centre, or our generous leave arrangements. Check out our employment conditions Where will you feel most at home at the University of Twente ? Five faculties, around fifty programs, a wide variety of essential support services, and countless research options. There are plenty of opportunities waiting for you at the only campus university in the Netherlands. Which discipline best reflects your knowledge, experience, and career goals? Academic vacancies Support vacancies University of Twente Drienerlolaan 5 7522NB Enschede +31(0)53 489 9111 info@utwente.nl Route Quicklinks Scientific Staff Support Staff Contact Follow us LinkedIn Twitter R