    "https://utwentecareers.nl/en/vacancies/2459/phd-positie-in-sociale-relaties-in-een-sportcontext-groepsdynamiek-en-het-floreren-van-jongeren/": {
      "title": "PhD positie in Sociale relaties in een sportcontext, groepsdynamiek en het floreren van jongeren",
      "description": "PhD positie in Sociale relaties in een sportcontext, groepsdynamiek en het floreren van jongeren - Looking for a job that matters? Vacancies Academic staff Support staff UT Student Jobs UT as employer UT as employer Employment conditions Career and development Pre and onboarding Tenure Track PhD EngD Working as a UT student Stories from UT employees Job alert About UT Campus Research institutes Strategy and culture Twente and Enschede Nederlands English en Nederlands English Vacancies PhD positie in Sociale relaties in een sportcontext, groepsdynamiek en het floreren van jongeren To vacancy overview Apply now EEMCS PhD PhD positie in Sociale relaties in een sportcontext, groepsdynamiek en het floreren van jongeren This vacancy is only available in Dutch. Click here to view the vacancy in Dutch. Apply now Hi! Are you my new colleague? Eline Meijerink Hi! Are you my new colleague? Clara Stegehuis Hi! Are you my new colleague? Britt Büter Hi! Are you my new colleague? Ying Wang Hi! Are you my new colleague? Jeroen Blok Hi! Are you my new colleague? Stefano Stramigioli Key takeaways Hours 40 hr. Salary indication Salary gross/monthly based on full-time € 3,204 - € 4,051 Deadline 8 Sep 2026 This vacancy is only available in Dutch. Click here to view the vacancy in Dutch. University of Twente Drienerlolaan 5 7522NB Enschede +31(0)53 489 9111 info@utwente.nl Route Quicklinks Scientific Staff Support Staff Contact Follow us LinkedIn Twitter RSS Cookies & Privacy Stay informed. After registration you will regularly receive our new vacancies. Subscribe as External applicant UT Employee (will receive internal vacancies) Email address Login Occupation Administrative & facility Assistant professor Associate professor Education EngD Finance HRM IT Lecturer Legal staff Management Marketing and communications PhD Policy and staff PostDoc Professor Research, development, innovation Researcher Technical and laboratory You are signed up for the Job alert Previous